        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Vogel, Keith Smart\n- Organizations: Indiana Pacers, Sacramento Kings, NBA\n- Roles: Head coaches, owner\n- Events: 2011-12 NBA season\n\nFacts:\n- The Sacramento Kings finished 11th in the NBA's Western Conference during the 2011-12 season.\n- Keith Smart was the head coach of the Sacramento Kings during the 2011-12 season.\n- Frank Vogel became the head coach of the Indiana Pacers.\n- The Indiana Pacers are an NBA team.\n- The statement says the former head coach of the 2011-12 11th-place Western Conference team is now the head coach and owner for the Indiana Pacers.",
