        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Portland Trail Blazers, Seattle SuperSonics, Indiana Pacers, National Basketball Association\n- People: Nate McMillan\n- Events: 2011–12 Portland Trail Blazers season\n- Roles: Head coach, basketball coach, player\n\nFacts:\n- The 2011–12 Portland Trail Blazers season was the franchise's 42nd season in the National Basketball Association.\n- Nate McMillan coached the Seattle SuperSonics from 2000 to 2005.\n- Nate McMillan coached the Portland Trail Blazers from 2005 to 2012.\n- The Portland Trail Blazers finished the 2011–12 season in 11th place in the Western Conference with a 28–38 record.\n- Nate McMillan, born on August 3, 1964, is an American basketball coach and former player.\n- Nate McMillan is the head coach of the Indiana Pacers in the National Basketball Association.",
